## Notes: Morph window for OctoWoW: every creature model in the client (16,000+, with 3D previews), every race and visible item. Try them on your character and save outfits in a wardrobe. Type /dmorph. Needs VanillaHelpers v1.1.0+ (OctoLauncher's vanillaHelpers mod); previews need ClassicAPI.
